Z||000005||Songman||04-09-2001||01:13 AM||||I wouldn't worry about keeping your Fiero stock to make it worth more... Fieros are made to be enjoyed and driven. We all love them, but I don't know that we'll ever see them sitting on the collector's block. <P>For my money, a really sweet looking modified Fiero is worth more than a stock one.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
